Hi Arjun,

I've attached the one-page guide for the submission desk. If a replacement de=
cision memo arrives by 16:00 on Friday, September 11, please keep the receipt=
 time for each copy, including the earlier one, and identify the last valid c=
opy received by the deadline that can be opened as that person's memo.

If a file will not open, record the attempted receipt and check with the send=
er as described on the sheet before treating it as a valid replacement. Wheth=
er someone read the case on paper is not part of the receipt decision.

Could you keep the receipt times for the handoff? I'll bring the last valid m=
emo and its source references together for Erin after the deadline.

Thanks,
Heather

